WEBVTT

00:00:01.514 --> 00:00:04.566
Open Numbers and click Add number

00:00:04.566 --> 00:00:11.454
Pick the provider and account

00:00:11.454 --> 00:00:18.218
Pick the country and region

00:00:18.218 --> 00:00:21.539
Click Buy Number on the number you want

00:00:21.539 --> 00:00:26.587
Confirm with Buy Number

00:00:26.587 --> 00:00:31.685
The number appears in All Numbers
